  "checked": "2026-10-06",
  "notes": "Primarily a publisher/exhibitor trade and consumer gaming expo (PlayStation, Sega, Nintendo, Square Enix, etc. have show-floor presences) rather than a classic autograph con, but it runs a large, officially paged 'International Guests' and 'Influencers and Guests' program (93 people total between the two pages) with individual photos, so the full roster is captured. Many are Brazilian esports-org rosters (MIBR, Team Liquid Brazil) and talent-agency streamers/dubbing actors (Giik Entertainment, Maestri Consulting, Maximus Agencies) whose cards give only an agency name and a one-line role, so 'Known for' is kept to that line; stage names are used as given (real names substituted where the card states one, e.g. Amanda 'AMD' Abreu, Marie Freire, Niel_Max/Daniel). Venue confirmed as Distrito Anhembi via the site's own /local-e-como-chegar/ page. 2026-10-06 refresh: added 12 guests (esports pros, streamers and creators) newly shown as cards on the same Influencers and Guests page in today's render; no picked guest was missing."
